  <Comment Source="WikiPathways-description">Insulin (INS) binds and activates the insulin receptor INSR, which in turn phosphorylates insulin receptor substrate 1 (IRS1) to propagate downstream metabolic and mitogenic signalling in human cells.</Comment>
